{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Void Corridors</strong> is a first-person puzzle horror game where you navigate a maze-like environment, solve intricate puzzles, and manage limited resources to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Scavenge for energy to keep your flashlight powered and maintain the generator to illuminate the corridors. Every second of light counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzle Solving</strong> \u2013 Solve a range of environmental puzzles to unlock new areas, uncover hidden secrets, and descend deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udeaa <strong>Exploration &amp; Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Wander dark, shifting corridors lit by an eerie glow. Stay alert\u2014sometimes, it feels like the walls themselves are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 The deeper you go, the more intense the feeling of being observed. Unravel the mystery of the corridors before the presence lurking in the shadows finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you uncover the truth\u2014or become lost in the void?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Voltage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/67b1154fee65776477e25d0b1f0782c424e25db9.jpg"},{"name":"Lost & Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/e45f0aff70ee195e1d9ce0eef469ce483e61ee75.jpg"},{"name":"Data Delivery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/ce5c44d34e79567f8011a30d5424258d412b2fe8.jpg"},{"name":"Hidden in Plain Sight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/5614f7513711f38d13fadf371d77dd2f5600e9bd.jpg"},{"name":"Fixed Gaze","path":"https://cdn.ak